# Backend layer ownership

- **Write**: `server/src/controllers/**`, `server/src/routes/**`, `server/src/middleware/**`, `server/src/utils/**`, and `server/src/services/**` except integration-owned QuickBooks/Sheets services (see Integrations rule).
- **Read-only mindset**: `server/src/models/**`, `server/src/integrations/**`, `server/src/jobs/**` as contracts to call, not to reimplement.
- **Do not**: edit Mongoose schemas; call Google/QuickBooks APIs or SDKs directly; run long sync inline in request handlers—enqueue or delegate per existing patterns.

Sync triggers must be idempotent and safe to retry. Align with `.agents/backend/AGENTS.md`.
